abstract: >
  Raw absorbance kinetics from a Biolog PM08 media-optimization screen
  (4 x 96-well plates, 590 nm dye reduction and 740 nm turbidity, 48 h at
  30 °C), together with the analysis pipeline that produces per-condition
  growth kinetics (AUC, mu_max, doubling time, lag) and identifies the top
  media designs relative to a plate-matched control. Accompanies the
  manuscript listed under `preferred-citation`.

